5997,"text":"e"},{"start1":5277,"start2":6000,"text":" shadow dwells\nWithin a stream’s "},{"start1":5315,"start2":6039,"text":" "},{"start1":5317,"start2":6041,"text":"lass, is to that stream\nIn unity of beauty,"},{"start1":5360,"start2":6089,"text":" "},{"start1":5361,"start2":6129,"text":"when its green\nAnd pleasant top sways gently to and fro\nIn evening’s balmy gale. Yea, her whole being\nWas as harmonious to the mind as are\n"},{"start1":5500,"start2":6271,"text":"Most perfect strains, of purest tones prolonged,\nTo music"},{"start1":5558,"start2":6329,"text":"loving ears.\n"},{"start1":5575,"start2":6342,"text":"But full of dole\nIs w"},{"start1":5596,"start2":6364,"text":"at remains to tell. Ere twice eight Springs\nHad bloomed about her being, a most fell\nAnd secret malady"},{"start1":5699,"start2":6466,"text":" did feed amid\nThe roses of her cheek, and on the moist\nAnd rubious pastur"},{"start1":5775,"start2":6540,"text":"e of her lips, but still\nFelon-like shunn"},{"start1":5817,"start2":6582,"text":"d"},{"start1":5818,"start2":6584,"text":" the lustre of her eyes"},{"start1":5841,"start2":6608,"text":"\nThat more resplendent grew. And so before\nThose glowing orb"},{"start1":5902,"start2":6668,"text":"s had turned their starry light\nUpon one human face with other "},{"start1":5966,"start2":6733,"text":"o"},{"start1":5969,"start2":6736,"text":"\nThan a meek daughter "},{"start1":5994,"start2":6760,"text":" fond sister "},{"start1":6009,"start2":6781,"text":"o"},{"start1":6011,"start2":6786,"text":"s"},{"start1":6012,"start2":6822,"text":";\nEre her white arms and heaving bosom held\nA "},{"start1":6062,"start2":6868,"text":"n"},{"start1":6069,"start2":6869,"text":"e"},{"start1":6070,"start2":6874,"text":"n"},{"start1":6072,"start2":6876,"text":" other than the "},{"start1":6088,"start2":6898,"text":"head\nOf sickness, or a stranger babe, the grass\nThat whistled dry in the autumnal wind"},{"start1":6174,"start2":6985,"text":"\nWas billowing round her grave!\n—"},{"start1":6207,"start2":7020,"text":"And yet I live\nWith dogs and cats and heartless human things,\nWithin a world that knoweth her no more"},{"start1":6308,"start2":7122,"text":"\n"},{"start1":6314,"start2":7126,"text":" "},{"start1":6318,"start2":7130,"text":" "},{"start1":6320,"start2":7132,"text":"e"},{"start1":6322,"start2":7133,"text":" "},{"start1":6325,"start2":7134,"text":"t"},{"start1":6328,"start2":7137,"text":" "},{"start1":6330,"start2":7140,"text":" "},{"start1":6334,"start2":7149,"text":"r"},{"start1":6336,"start2":7152,"text":"e"},{"start1":6339,"start2":7154,"text":" "},{"start1":6341,"start2":7162,"text":"a"},{"start1":6343,"start2":7168,"text":"d"},{"start1":6349,"start2":7169,"text":" "},{"start1":6350,"start2":7172,"text":"t"},{"start1":6352,"start2":7173,"text":"o"},{"start1":6357,"start2":7174,"text":" th"},{"start1":6365,"start2":7177,"text":"e "},{"start1":6369,"start2":7183,"text":" "},{"start1":6370,"start2":7185,"text":"f"},{"start1":6374,"start2":7188,"text":"h"},{"start1":6375,"start2":7190,"text":" "},{"start1":6376,"start2":7193,"text":"a"},{"start1":6378,"start2":7194,"text":"d "},{"start1":6381,"start2":7197,"text":"a"},{"start1":6383,"start2":7200,"text":",\n"},{"start1":6388,"start2":7203,"text":"n"},{"start1":6389,"start2":7205,"text":" "},{"start1":6390,"start2":7207,"text":"as"},{"start1":6392,"start2":7210,"text":" "},{"start1":6394,"start2":7215,"text":" "},{"start1":6399,"start2":7218,"text":"i"},{"start1":6402,"start2":7220,"text":" f"},{"start1":6405,"start2":7222,"text":"o"},{"start1":6408,"start2":7223,"text":"r "},{"start1":6415,"start2":7229,"text":" "},{"start1":6417,"start2":7231,"text":"a"},{"start1":6419,"start2":7236,"text":"e"},{"start1":6423,"start2":7239,"text":" "},{"start1":6427,"start2":7241,"text":"n "},{"start1":6429,"start2":7244,"text":"a"},{"start1":6433,"start2":7247,"text":".\n"},{"start1":6440,"start2":7250,"text":"i"},{"start1":6442,"start2":7251,"text":"t"},{"start1":6446,"start2":7